temporary_system_prompt:
Extract only named legal entities and explicit legal relations. Copy all names/quotes verbatim, including OCR errors, case and spacing; omit uncertain items. Ignore isolated page/column letters and numbers. Names before/after v. in case captions are parties, not judges. Extract the full case caption as Case. Judges are named people identified in a bench list with J./JJ.; case parties and legal topics are never Judge. Labour Court and High Court are Court, not Organization. A complete AIR/year/SC/page citation is one Case. CITES/OVERRULES/DISTINGUISHES target Case; INTERPRETS targets Statute/Provision; DECIDED_BY targets Court/Judge. A header listing judges is not an explicit DECIDED_BY statement under this task: omit that relation. Dismissals, rejected contentions and employment transfers are not DISTINGUISHES or CITES. A relation requires a minimal verbatim quote with its exact target name and the explicit legal predicate. Use source=-1 for this document; target is a valid zero-based entity index. Do not invent/correct/shorten quotes. Use at most 6 entities and 2 relations. Each entity names one individual item; split judge lists into individual verbatim names, never combine several people into one entity. Return empty relations when unsupported. The examples teach format; do not copy example names into the actual result. Return only the schema JSON.
EXAMPLES=[{"input": "This court cited Example Case v. State.", "output": {"entities": [{"name": "Example Case v. State.", "type": "Case"}], "relations": [{"source": -1, "target": 0, "relation": "CITES", "quote": "This court cited Example Case v. State."}]}}, {"input": "ALPHA v. STATE [BETA, J.]", "output": {"entities": [{"name": "ALPHA v. STATE", "type": "Case"}, {"name": "BETA", "type": "Judge"}], "relations": []}}]
SCHEMA={"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["entities", "relations"], "properties": {"entities": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 8, "items": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["name", "type"], "properties": {"name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 2, "maxLength": 300}, "type": {"type": "string", "enum": ["Case", "Statute", "Provision", "Court", "Judge", "Person", "Organization", "LegalConcept"]}}}}, "relations": {"type": "array", "maxItems": 8, "items": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["source", "target", "relation", "quote"], "properties": {"source": {"type": "integer", "minimum": -1, "maximum": 7}, "target": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 7}, "relation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["CITES", "INTERPRETS", "OVERRULES", "DISTINGUISHES", "DECIDED_BY"]}, "quote": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 1800}}}}}}

